; Proofs that the built-in schedule scorers' prefix bounds are admissible and
; that pruning with them is exact. They model the OCaml bounds in
; plugin/scheduleRanking.ml and plugin/budgetAwareScore.ml; verification mode checks the premises at run time.

(alias
  (name runtest)
  (deps (alias_rec all)))

(coq.theory
  (name QuickChick.TestingBoundProofs)
  (modules DensityPrefixBound BudgetAwarePrefixBound DensityLookahead))
